motions.motion_text:
WHEREAS report ACS2026-PDB-PS-0064 recommends several amendments to Zoning By-law 2026-50 to address matters currently under appeal, including site-specific matters and revisions to Section 110 – Continuation of Approved Applications, Exceptions and Schedules to add clarity;
AND WHEREAS report ACS2026-PDB-PS-0064 does not contain all language necessary to add the clarity sought to section 110, and the map contained in Document 1D contains a technical error;
THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that Document 2 be amended by replacing Item 2 with the following:
Amend Subsection 110(4) of Zoning By-law 2026-50 by replacing it with the following:
(4) In areas inside Area B shown on Schedule A13, where exceptions, schedules and other zone code suffixes apply and the primary zone is H2 – Hub Zone 2, H3 – Hub Zone 3, MS1 – Mainstreet Zone 1, MS2 – Mainstreet Zone 2, CM1 – Minor Corridor Zone 1 and CM2 -– Minor Corridor Zone 2, then:
THEREFORE BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that Map 1D be replaced with the Map attached as Attachment 1 hereto;
THEREFORE BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that pursuant to subsection 34(17) of thePlanning Act, no further notice be given.
